
# Conventional Commit — format:
#   <type>[(<scope>)]: <short summary>
#
# type   : feat | fix | chore | docs | refactor | test | ci | perf | build
# scope  : optional, e.g. (auth) | (api) | (ui)
# summary: imperative mood, ≤72 chars — "add X" not "added X"
#
# Body (optional) — blank line after summary, then explain WHY.
# Wrap at 72 characters.
#
# Footer (optional):
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
#   Closes #<issue>
